bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Profile Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Avatar
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/auth/me (cookie)
activate Router

Router -> Router: 3. Check token / role
activate Router
space
deactivate Router

loop Invalid token / expired token / Invalid role
  Router --> UI: 3.1. Show error
  UI --> User: 3.2. Cannot load profile
end 

Router -> AuthController: 4. getMe(req)
activate AuthController
AuthController -> AuthService: 5. getMe(req)
activate AuthService

AuthService -> UserModel: 6. findById(req.user.user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 7. user / null
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 8. user / null
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> AuthService: 9. user / null
deactivate UserModel

AuthService -> AuthService: 10. Check user
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

opt User not found
  AuthService --> AuthController: 10.1. UnauthorizedException
  AuthController --> Router: 10.2. HTTP response
  Router --> UI: 10.3. Show error
  UI --> User: 10.4. Cannot load profile
end
  
AuthService --> AuthController: 11. Profile data
deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 12. HTTP response
deactivate AuthController
Router --> UI: 13. Render profile / show error
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 14. Show profile
deactivate UI
deactivate User